From 8022bed7afb883c06bc053b2bf27ff46dae8c7a6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christian Roessner <c@roessner.co>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 14:45:42 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] bounce: pass DSN origin evidence through cleanup

Collect the original envelope while reading the source queue file. For locally generated null-sender notifications, pass a versioned and bounded base64url record to the normal cleanup service.

Keep the evidence in transient cleanup state, reject inconsistent input, and fall back to an ordinary notification when the original envelope cannot be represented.
